--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,21 @@
 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.13-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> Lifecycle hardening; experimental E2LB connection remains unverified.
+> 连接生命周期加固；E2LB 实车仍未验证。
+
+### English
+- Reject stale Wi-Fi prompt claims and late UI deliveries; use monotonic wait budgets.
+- Bind pending endpoint observation to the originating connection and live control link.
+- Stop interrupted bootstrap waits without training authentication parameters on cancellation.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 拒绝过期 Wi-Fi 弹窗请求和迟到的 UI 投递，采用单调时钟等待预算。
+- 空端点观察绑定原连接与存活的控制链路。
+- 中断启动等待时及时退出，不将取消写成认证参数试探失败。
+
 ## [v0.1.12-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > Experimental receiver-specific transport hardening; no confirmed E2LB connection fix.
